==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[strike]] [[zone]]}}

# {{context|baseball|lang=en}} The area through which if a [[pitch]]ed ball passes, it will be called a [[strike]], typically from the [[batter|batter's]] knees to the belt and the width of [[home plate]].
#: ''That [[umpire]] often compresses the '''strike zone''' late in the game.''

